SIMPLE EQ BUILT WITH THE JUCE FRAMEWORK 
following a tutorial by MatKat Music posted here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i_Iq4_Kd7Rc 
and making some improvements of my own.

The current design implements a 5 band EQ with Lowpass and Highpass Filters

The 5 bands have adjustable frequency, gain, and q values that can be changed using implemented knobs
the overall eq band is displayed with markers for each band to create an easy to use UI.
